      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "A classic stick grenade: a steel head packed with gunpowder on a wooden handle. It deals heavy blast damage in a radius of about five blocks and bounces a few times before it settles, so you can throw it around a corner. Sixteen come out of one LV Assembler run.\n\nThe recipe is two steel plates, four gunpowder and a wooden stick. Hold sixteen to finish the quest. Hold right click to wind up a throw; the longer you hold, the farther it goes.\n\n[warn]The fuse is ten seconds long and the blast hurts you too. Throw it and step back. By default it does not break blocks, but a server can turn that on.[/warn]",
